{"title":"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/6/01663150b98ebd6cbfe602dcd3f41a0b8bb144b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{550 + 50}{5^2 + 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"73\" height=\"40\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/c/71c8983eacca16aabf634bec8b645472695eaf65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 32 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 40 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 65 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/5/fa5bebc6bf533f7460575ee0a0dbb23adcf1d6ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{550 + 50}{5^2 + 5} = \\frac{600}{25 + 5} = \\frac{600}{30} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"294\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal\">2006 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php